How It Works (Ω Tie-In)
工作原理（Ω 关联）SCL: Uses cosine similarity to bridge old/new persona vectors (e.g., tone/memory/logic dimensions). Strong continuity (>0.8) passes; weak triggers retrain—core to the whitepaper's "Persona Inheritance Bridge."
SCL ：利用余弦相似度来连接新旧角色向量（例如，语气/记忆/逻辑维度）。强连续性（>0.8）通过；弱连续性触发重新训练——这是白皮书“角色继承桥梁”的核心。
Quantum Bridge: Simulates Bell entanglement + phase shift (from vector diff), with fidelity=1.0 showing perfect "quantum boost" (real noise would add realism). Accelerates fuzzy semantics in the Mesh without leaks.
量子桥 ：模拟贝尔纠缠+相移（来自矢量差分），保真度为 1.0 时展现完美的“量子增强”（真实噪声可增强真实感）。加速网格中的模糊语义处理，且无泄漏。
ZKP Ready: Hash fidelity locally for privacy-proof VAL (Verification Layer).
ZKP 就绪 ：本地哈希保真度，用于隐私保护 VAL（验证层）。

This lightweight sim scales to n_qubits=4+ for more qubits—tune n_qubits and watch fidelity evolve!
这个轻量级模拟器可以扩展到 n_qubits=4+，以容纳更多量子比特——调整 n_q​​ubits 并观察保真度的演变！Contributing
